 "summary": "Chip resistor arrays on an alumina substrate holding two, four or eight equal, separate resistors, each joining a pair of opposite end terminals. Eleven body types are offered with convex (2D02, 2D03, 4D02, 4D03, 16P8), concave (2C02, 4C02, 4C03) or flat (2F01, 4F01) terminals, from 0.80 × 0.60 mm to 4.00 × 1.60 mm, in ±1% and ±5% tolerance and as 0 Ω jumpers. Most types are rated 1/16 W at 70 ℃ and 50 V working; 4DP3 is rated 1/10 W and the flat 2F01 and 4F01 1/20 W at 12.5 V.",
